# 裡有登入憑證，一個都不該進版控。
tools/cyberbiz-monthly-payout/chrome-profile/
tools/cyberbiz-monthly-payout/staging/
tools/cyberbiz-monthly-payout/reports/
tools/cyberbiz-monthly-payout/screenshots/

